# Agent Memory Workflow

- Follow project/user rules strictly before implementing.
- If any requirement is unclear, ambiguous, or missing, ask the user before proceeding.
- Do not guess hidden assumptions when they affect behavior, scope, data, or architecture.

## Completion Tracking

- Maintain a visible checklist for multi-step work.
- After finishing each task, mark it as completed immediately.
- Keep exactly one active task at a time when possible.
- Before final response, verify all requested tasks are marked done.

## Minimum confirmation pattern

- Clarify first when needed.
- Execute the task.
- Mark the completed item.
- Report status and next pending item (if any).
